	CASE WHEN GONDERENALACAK>0 AND REHBERID=0 THEN GONDERENKOD WHEN GONDERENBORC>0 AND REHBERID<>0 THEN GONDERENKOD WHEN GONDERENALACAK>0 AND REHBERID<>0 THEN ALANCARIKOD ELSE ALANKOD END AS GONDERENKOD ,
	CASE WHEN GONDERENBORC>0   AND REHBERID=0 THEN GONDERENAD  WHEN GONDERENBORC>0 AND REHBERID<>0 THEN GONDERENAD  WHEN GONDERENALACAK>0 AND REHBERID<>0 THEN ALANCARIAD  ELSE ALANAD END AS GONDERENAD ,
	CASE WHEN GONDERENALACAK>0 AND REHBERID=0 THEN ALANKOD     WHEN GONDERENBORC>0 AND REHBERID<>0 THEN ALANCARIKOD WHEN GONDERENALACAK>0 AND REHBERID<>0 THEN GONDERENKOD ELSE GONDERENKOD END AS ALANKOD ,
	CASE WHEN GONDERENBORC>0   AND REHBERID=0 THEN ALANAD      WHEN GONDERENBORC>0 AND REHBERID<>0 THEN ALANCARIAD  WHEN GONDERENALACAK>0 AND REHBERID<>0 THEN GONDERENAD  ELSE GONDERENAD END AS ALANAD ,
