	CASE WHEN GONDERENALACAK>0 AND REHBERID=0 THEN ALANKUR     WHEN GONDERENBORC>0 AND REHBERID<>0 THEN GONDERENKUR WHEN GONDERENALACAK>0 AND REHBERID<>0 THEN ALANCARIKUR ELSE GONDERENKUR END AS GONDERENKUR ,
	CASE WHEN GONDERENBORC>0   AND REHBERID=0 THEN ABS(ALANBORC-ALANALACAK) WHEN GONDERENBORC>0 AND REHBERID<>0 AND coalesce(TURU,'''')='''' THEN ABS(ALANCARIBORC-ALANCARIALACAK) WHEN GONDERENBORC>0 AND REHBERID<>0 AND coalesce(TURU,'''')=''ÇEKLER'' THEN GONDERENALACAK ELSE ABS(GONDERENBORC-GONDERENALACAK) END AS ALANTUTAR ,
